fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"vulkan/GstH264Encoder.html#GstH264Encoder:i-frames","fragment":"\n\ti-frames\n\nForce the number of i-frames insertion within one GOP. More I-Frames will\nincrease the size of the video, but it will be more resilient to data\nlose.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tConstruct\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t0\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});